{"meta":{"id":"55a3de40-86b6-4d2a-b03e-dbb7caea6284","publication_id":"30c7e4c1-15ed-46d8-a23d-32c90e011794","web_title":"Forjando el Futuro de la Web3 desde el Sur: Kick-off Stellar en iDEAUFRO","parameterized_web_title":"forjando-el-futuro-de-la-web3-desde-el-sur-kick-off-stellar-en-ideaufro","utm_params_enabled":true,"utm_campaign":"forjando-el-futuro-de-la-web3-desde-el-sur-kick-off-stellar-en-ideaufro","utm_medium":"referral","utm_source":"blog.telluscoop.com","web_subtitle":"","web_audiences":"free","status":"published","active":true,"featured":false,"override_scheduled_at":"2026-04-01T01:11:45.281Z","slug":"stellarchileenlaufro","is_premium":false,"image_url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/fb8b3490-3b42-4cd4-bd1a-ad046c31a5a6/Kick_OFF.jpg?t=1775005773","image_width":1928,"image_height":1088,"meta_default_title":"Forjando el Futuro de la Web3 desde el Sur: Kick-off Stellar en iDEAUFRO","meta_default_description":"La Cooperativa Blockchain de LatAm","meta_og_title":"Forjando el Futuro de la Web3 desde el Sur: Kick-off Stellar en iDEAUFRO","meta_og_description":"La Cooperativa Blockchain de LatAm","meta_twitter_title":"Forjando el Futuro de la Web3 desde el Sur: Kick-off Stellar en iDEAUFRO","meta_twitter_description":"La Cooperativa Blockchain de LatAm","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":"default","enforce_gated_content":false,"enable_popup_on_scroll":false,"email_capture_title":"Suscríbete para seguir leyendo","email_capture_message":"Este contenido es gratuito, pero debes estar suscrito a Tellus Cooperative para continuar leyendo.","email_capture_cta":"Suscríbete","estimated_reading_time":3,"estimated_reading_time_display":"3 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12","name":"Pau Koh","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/pau_headshot_1.png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/thumb_pau_headshot_1.png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/landscape_pau_headshot_1.png"}},"bio":"𝘊𝘔𝘎𝘙/𝘛𝘦𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴 𝘊𝘰𝘰𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦","twitter_handle":"kl0ren","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":null,"linkedin_url":null,"tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":null,"bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"ca4f9cd8-03f4-4baf-a2e0-d9f5ba3df073","display":"Cursos","slug":"cursos"}],"created_at":"2026-04-01T01:07:55Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T01:11:49Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"qu-es-realmente-blockchain\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Qué es realmente Blockchain?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Muchos asocian la \"cadena de bloques\" solo con criptomonedas, pero es mucho más. Imagina un </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>libro contable digital</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> que todos pueden ver pero nadie puede borrar ni falsificar. Es una red descentralizada que permite transferir valor (dinero, activos, datos) de forma instantánea y segura, sin depender de un banco central o una autoridad única.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En esta sesión, </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong><a href=\"https://x.com/kl0ren\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Pau Koh</a></strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://x.com/kl0ren\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"> </a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">y </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong><a href=\"https://x.com/alex0tico\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Alex Hernández</a></strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> explicaron cómo esta tecnología está dando paso al \"Internet del Valor\", donde el usuario recupera el control de su identidad y sus activos.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"la-hoja-de-ruta-para-los-nuevos-emb\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">La Hoja de Ruta para los Nuevos Embajadores</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Este programa de 12 semanas no es solo teoría; es un espacio de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>co-work e innovación constante</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. Los estudiantes, desde ingeniería hasta diseño y negocios, fueron guiados en sus primeros pasos dentro del ecosistema de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, una red diseñada para que el sistema financiero mundial pueda ser abierto y accesible para todos.</span></p></div><div id=\"el-rol-de-stellar-passport\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El Rol de Stellar Passport</span></h4></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Durante el evento, se realizó una demostración en vivo de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://demo.stellarpassport.xyz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>demo.stellarpassport.xyz</strong></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. Esta herramienta será fundamental para los futuros embajadores:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Identidad Digital:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Permite a los estudiantes gestionar sus perfiles dentro de la red.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Seguimiento del Programa:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Se usará para validar el progreso de las sesiones.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Acceso a Oportunidades:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Es el puente para postular proyectos a fondos internacionales y becas de desarrollo.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://demo.stellarpassport.xyz\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Passport — Explore the Stellar Ecosystem (Beta · Testnet)</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Passport is in beta on testnet. Explore projects, scan QR codes, collect stamps, and unlock rewards across the Stellar ecosystem.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">demo.stellarpassport.xyz</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\"><img src=\"https://demo.stellarpassport.xyz/OG_passport-beta.png\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"construyendo-comunidad\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Construyendo Comunidad</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El ambiente en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://ideaufro.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">iDEAUFRO</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> fue de colaboración pura. Entre rebanadas de pizza y networking, los asistentes descubrieron que no se necesita ser un experto en código para impactar en Web3. El programa busca perfiles diversos que quieran resolver problemas reales de nuestra zona usando herramientas globales.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¿Qué sigue?</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Las próximas semanas estarán dedicadas a la creación de proyectos, aprendizaje técnico y, sobre todo, a consolidar la red de embajadores en el sur de Chile.</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">\"No importa tu carrera o tu año; si tienes ganas de construir soluciones de impacto, el futuro de internet se está escribiendo hoy en iDEAUFRO.\"</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¡Prepárate para la Sesión 2! El viaje hacia la descentralización apenas comienza.</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span></p></div></div>","publication":{"name":"Tellus Cooperative","description":"La Cooperativa Blockchain de LatAm","url":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/","twitter_url":"https://x.com/telluscoop","instagram_url":"https://instagram.com/telluscoop","linkedin_url":"https://linkedin.com/company/Tellus-Cooperative","youtube_url":"https://youtube.com/@telluscoop","discord_url":"https://discord.gg/V4eSGWA3PK"}}